SUMMARY:School Fair
LOCATION:3720 Spectrum Boulevard Tampa \, FL 33612 United States
DESCRIPTION:Planning for 2027? Meet schools all under one roofregister tod
 ay to secure your spot. Get all your questions answered in one afternoon a
 t the Private School Collective of Tampas 2nd Annual Private School Fair o
 n Saturday\, October 3rd . Whether you want to try private school for the 
 first time or switch to a new school for 2027\, this free event puts the b
 est local options in one room. Why Attend? Win Scholarships: Enter our fre
 e raffle for a chance to win private school scholarships for the 20272028 
 school year and other fun prizes! Talk to Real People: Meet current studen
 ts\, parents\, and school leaders to ask questions and hear honest stories
 . Find Great Programs: Learn about top local choices for science\, art\, s
 ports\, and special learning support. Save Time: Get a free checklist to h
 elp you compare schools quickly and easily. Attend Free Workshops: Get hel
 pful tips on how to pick the right school and pay for tuition. The event i
 s 100 free to attend. Join us on Saturday\, October 3rd\, and find the per
 fect school to help your child succeed! \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.g
 ov/node/195076
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/195076
END:VEVENT
