SUMMARY:Meet Me at the Seahorse: A TRAVELERS NOTEBOOK Experience
LOCATION:211 South Howard Ave Tampa \, FL 33606 United States
DESCRIPTION:One part meet-up and one-part creative play is our Fall TRAVEL
 ERS COMPANY notebook event! Meet fellow TRAVELERS NOTEBOOK enthusiasts as 
 we design our own custom notebook refills. We will be using various types 
 of refills and adding modern and vintage inspiration to create a truly cus
 tom notebook. We will also personalize our covers with collage. No two wil
 l be alike and we will create a regular size version as well as a passport
  size version. All materials supplied: Also\, feel free to bring something
  to share with the group if you would like. Not necessary but makes for fu
 n discovery! \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/195401
