SUMMARY:Walk To End Alzheimer039\\\;s
LOCATION:401 Channelside Drive Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Residents are invited to join the Walk to End Alzheimers Tampa
  on Saturday\, October 17th\, 2026\, held at Benchmark International Arena
 \, 401 Channelside Drive in Tampa. You can register today by going to Alz.
 orgTampaWalk (http:alz.orgTampaWalk) Today more than 7 million Americans a
 re currently living with Alzheimers\, and over 580\,000 people in Florida 
 are living with the disease. An estimated 11 million family members and fr
 iends provide unpaid care for those affected by Alzheimers and other demen
 tias nationwide \, and more than 870\,000 unpaid caregivers are Florida re
 sidents. On Walk Day\, registration begins at 8:00 a.m.\, followed by the 
 flower ceremony at 8:30 a.m.\, and the Walk immediately follows. Those aff
 ected by Alzheimers are honored by participants with the poignant Promise 
 Garden ceremony  a mission-focused experience that signifies our solidarit
 y in the fight against the disease. During the ceremony\, walkers will car
 ry flowers of various colors\, each color representing their personal conn
 ection to the disease. For more information on this years Walk to End Alzh
 eimers Tampa\, contact Carole Brennan at naavilesalz.org (https:d.docs.liv
 e.net7bfb6b9463f19adcDocumentsALZ20ASSOCcobrennanalz.org) or 727-331-7899.
  \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/193766
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/193766
END:VEVENT
