SUMMARY:Good Vibes: A Mental Health Block Party
LOCATION:2601 E 2nd Ave Tampa \, FL 33605 United States
DESCRIPTION:Good Vibes: A Mental Health Block Party Family fun\, community
  connection resources for healthier minds. Date: Saturday\, October 24\, 2
 026 Time: 11:00 AM  3:00 PM Location: Coppertail Brewing Co. Back Lot Admi
 ssion: FREE  Family-Friendly Open to All Be here for yourself. Be here for
  your friends. Be here for tomorrow. Love IV Lawrence and Coppertail Brewi
 ng Co. invite you to Good Vibes: A Mental Health Block Partya community-dr
 iven event bridging the gap for local wellness. Were combining a fun\, wel
 coming block party atmosphere with meaningful access to mental health supp
 ort and resources. What to Expect: Live music and entertainment Interactiv
 e games family-friendly activity stations Food\, drinks\, and special gues
 ts Passport Activity: Complete your card as you meet local resource leader
 s to win prizes! Stronger minds build a stronger community. Join us as we 
 bring mental health into the open and celebrate connection right here in T
 ampa Bay. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/196151
