SUMMARY:Shadow Journaling
LOCATION:211 South Howard Ave Tampa \, FL 33606 United States
DESCRIPTION:Break out from the dark and discover a lighter\, freer you. Di
 scover the healing of a shadow journal. Release the things that have been 
 holding you back and experience profound personal growth. Change starts wi
 th understanding unconscious blocks\, processing them and moving forward. 
 Be fearless\, confident and believe in yourself. Step out of the shadows a
 nd move towards the light. Align with your true self and start living the 
 life you have always dreamed of. Create positive change now. Be authentica
 lly you. Includes your journal\, writing instruments\, and tools for a sel
 f-exploration journey! \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/196031
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196031
