SUMMARY:Guppyween at The Florida Aquarium
LOCATION:701 Channelside Dr Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Get in the (un)spooky spirit at The Florida Aquarium! Dress up
  in your favorite costumes and join us for Guppyween \, a family-friendly 
 event perfect for the littlest monsters and merfolk\, pirates and princess
 es\, and everything in between. Children in costume get FREE admission wit
 h a paid parent or guardian. Activities include: Complimentary trick or tr
 eating on October 24\, 25 31 Animal encounters featuring creepy critters R
 ocky\, Tango\, and Xochi character appearances Costumed divers underwater 
 pumpkin carving And more! Please note: This offer is redeemable at the Aqu
 arium ticket window only \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/195911
