SUMMARY:FREE HUD Approved In person Homebuyer workshop
LOCATION:1002 E Palm Ave Tampa \, FL 33605 United States
DESCRIPTION:READY TO BECOME A HOMEOWNER? Join R.E.A.C.H. for our FREE HUD-
 Approved 8-Hour Homebuyer Workshop and learn what you need to know to prep
 are for homeownership\, including information about down payment assistanc
 e opportunities up to 100\,000. Saturday\, October 24\, 2026 8:30 AM  4:30
  PM Childrens Board 1002 E. Palm Ave.\, Tampa\, FL 33605 This workshop is 
 FREE\, but registration is REQUIRED. Space may be limited\, so dont wait! 
 Register today at www.reach4housing.org (http:www.reach4housing.org) or sc
 an the QR code on the flyer. Education is the first step. Homeownership co
 uld be the next. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/195731
