 ion: City Center at Hanna Avenue 2555 E. Hanna Ave. Tampa FL 33610 Tampa F
 orward: Building Tomorrow Together is a two-year project to update the Cit
 ys Land Development Code (LDC). A Public Meeting to discuss Installment Tw
 o of the Citys updated LDC will be held on Thursday\, October 29\, 2026\, 
 from 6:30 p.m. to 8:30 p.m. at the City Center at Hanna Avenue (2555 East 
 Hanna Avenue). Members of the public can attend in-person at City Center a
 t Hanna Avenue or may virtually attend the public meeting. To register to 
 virtually attend the public meeting\, complete the form at https:events.gc
 c.teams.microsoft.comevent114f6d37-03bd-4ef9-89f6-55dca67b5b648d9d0373-5c9
 1-45b4-905b-12fe918cb628?sourcecopyLinkLegacyShareEventDialog (https:event
 s.gcc.teams.microsoft.comevent114f6d37-03bd-4ef9-89f6-55dca67b5b648d9d0373
 -5c91-45b4-905b-12fe918cb628?sourcecopyLinkLegacyShareEventDialog) Persons
  requiring help in registering for virtual attendance should call 813-274-
 3100 ext. 2 for assistance . MEMBERS OF THE PUBLIC PRESENT AT THE METING M
 AY ADDRESS THE CONSULTANT AND CITY STAFF FOR 3 MINUTES AFTER PRESENTATIONS
  HAVE BEEN MADE. PUBLIC COMMENT WILL BE LIMITED TO INSTALLMENT TWO OF THE 
 UPDATED LDC. In accordance with the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) 
 and Section 286.26\, Florida Statutes\, persons with disabilities needing 
 a reasonable accommodation to participate in this public hearing or meetin
 g should contact the City of Tampas ADA Coordinator at least 48 hours prio
 r to the proceeding. The ADA Coordinator may be contacted via phone at 813
 -274-3964\, email at TampaADAtampagov.net\, or by submitting an ADA - Acco
 mmodations Request form available online at https:tampa.govADARequest (htt
 ps:tampa.govADARequest). For additional information\, please go to the web
 site at https:www.tampa.govdevelopment-coordinationtampa-updates-its-land-
 development-code (https:www.tampa.govdevelopment-coordinationtampa-updates
 -its-land-development-code). \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/196
 126
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196126
END:VEVENT
